    "My initial sense of responsibility to simply 'convince' both sides has evolved into a deeper understanding that this vote is not about persuasion, but about navigating a shared vulnerability—where rejecting the tax hike risks harming the most vulnerable, while accepting it demands trust that the wealthy will not evade their fair share."
  ]
}

